{
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of 2-3 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, then the boot's intro with its golfers for 20 s, Start (Enter) to",
  "the title and again to the main menu, and A (Space) on each menu as a player does (one player, Tournament, the first",
  "golfer, Toad Highlands) until the course loads, then its first hole once its flyover has played. There the golfer",
  "swings four times, A to start, A for the power and A at the impact, each shot flying and the next lie coming up,",
  "and the pause menu is opened with Start and closed again: a minute and a half on the course, on the game's clock",
  "(tools/shader_survey.js's clock(), 30 a second). Where the game is comes from which overlays it has loaded",
  "(loaded(), the same file)."
